        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A-Ressha de Ikou DS is a railway management simulation game for Nintendo DS, developed and published by Artdink. It is part of the A-Train series and focuses on building rail networks, developing surrounding areas, and managing transport services to support urban growth.\n\nPlayers lay tracks, create train routes, adjust timetables, manage finances, and develop land around stations. The game uses the Nintendo DS touch screen for map control and construction.",
